# 0.2.12 WdShop part 1 (tools/wardrobe_0_2_12_patch.py 3 + 4): requip/<pkey>/shop.json = {format 1, bought, peak, pending?}. Its OWN file
# (a rollback to 0.2.11 never rewrites it). Memory = the last write that was read back; a write that fails changes nothing in memory.
